    "note": "Amended Aug 30, 2021 (later floor votes were on this text; an earlier vote was on the March 25, 2021 text). Ellipses mark omitted sentences in 6389(c)(2). Also amends the Safety for All Act of 2016 (ammunition vendor exemption in 30342(b)) and Family Code 3044 (custody presumption rebuttal: new factor (G), court finding of a restrained person in possession of a firearm), which depends on gun possession and is counted as part of the same subject. Section 3044 appears four times (alternates tied to AB 1579 and AB 1171) and Section 11108.2 twice (alternate tied to SB 715). Section 1 finds the amendments to the 2016 Act consistent with its intent."
